  "posts": [
    {
      "id": "tg:BWEnews:16587",
      "handle": "t.me/BWEnews",
      "channel": "telegram",
      "minutes": -1218,
      "text": "BWENEWS: On-chain data shows about **$6.26B** in assets moved from Binance wallets to attacker-controlled addresses across 9 chains. The outflows hit Ethereum, Bitcoin, Tron, XRP, Solana, Arbitrum, Avalanche, Optimism and Base. 方程式新闻: 链上数据显示，约 62.6 亿美元的资产从 Binance 钱包转移至攻击者控制的地址，涉及 9 条链。资金流出波及 Ethereum、Bitcoin、Tron、XRP、Solana、Arbitrum、Avalanche、Optimism 和 Base。 ———————————— 2026-10-30 07:04:27 $SOL",
      "source": "https://t.me/BWEnews/16587"
    },
    {
      "id": "tg:glassnode:2067",
      "handle": "t.me/glassnode",
      "channel": "telegram",
      "minutes": -1222,
      "text": "Outflows across chains happened one after the other. XRP went first, then SOL shortly after, then BTC, ETH, USDT and TRX together, finally USDC. Binance's BNB balance was left untouched. It wasn't just the major assets. Dozens of smaller tokens saw a large share of their Binance balance leave in the same hour. According to our data, #FUN tokens were completely drained from the exchange. $SOL",
      "source": "https://t.me/glassnode/2067"
    },
    {
      "id": "tg:lookonchainchannel:10833",
      "handle": "t.me/lookonchainchannel",
      "channel": "telegram",
      "minutes": -1234,
      "text": "Attention! The Binance hacker is now dumping $PEPE, $UNI, $LINK, and other tokens on-chain for $ETH. Please note: The hacker still holds large amounts of the following altcoins, which could face heavy selling pressure: 217.497M $ENA ($39.51M) 7.579T $PEPE ($34.41M) 2.575M $LINK ($28.07M) 128.034K $AAVE ($15.9M) 74.56M $ARB ($11.54M) 1.938M $UNI ($12.62M) 21.852M $ONDO ($8.52M) 17.318M $WLD ($6.73M) 714.911M $FUN ($6.29M) 87.853M $ZAMA ($6.02M) 3.602M $ZRO ($5.69M) 3.382B $RSR ($5.02M) https://x.com/lookonchain/status/2115932070858158190 $PEPE",
      "source": "https://t.me/lookonchainchannel/10833"
    },
    {
      "id": "tg:lookonchainchannel:10834",
      "handle": "t.me/lookonchainchannel",
      "channel": "telegram",
      "minutes": -1195,
      "text": "Over $5.8B in assets has been stolen from Binance. More than $2.435B in stablecoins has been frozen. The hacker is currently dumping assets like $PEPE, $LINK, $UNI, and $ENA on-chain. Watch out for selling pressure. $PEPE",
      "source": "https://t.me/lookonchainchannel/10834"
    },
    {
