      "text": "The Binance hacker has finished dumping $UNI, $ENA, $PEPE, $LINK, $AAVE, $ONDO, and $WLD, swapping them for a total of 70,480 $ETH ($158.25M). Sold 7.02M $UNI($39.63M) at $5.65. Sold 217.5M $ENA($33.93M) at $0.16. Sold 7.77T $PEPE($31.66M) at $0.0000041. Sold 2.57M $LINK($26.05M) at $10.14. Sold 127,953 $AAVE($14.27M) at $111.55. Sold 21.85M $ONDO($6.62M) at $0.30. Sold 17.32M $WLD($6.09M) at $0.35. https://arkm.com/explorer/entity/ee28af27-2694-409b-b40e-cef142d00f33 $PEPE",
